# Second golden project: netlist-only, dut check, time limits, stale file, long name
file verilog counter.v
top counter
testbench netonly file tb_good.v top tb_good on netlist expect good.expect
testbench nodut file tb_good.v top tb_good dut nosuch
testbench hang_default file tb_hang.v
testbench hang_max file tb_hang.v max-time 1000
testbench stale file gone.v
testbench tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_tb_with_a_very_long_name_ file tb_good.v top tb_good
